    "mode":"single","concepts":[16,27],
    "stem":"Find $\\sqrt{82340}-\\sqrt{8234}$ by table lookup. Use lower-main addition for each root, keep the table numbers through the subtraction, and round the final difference to four significant figures. Which record is correct?",
