      {"id":"B","text":"Table components $287.0,90.74$; difference $196.26$; final $196.3$.","truth":"correct","derivation":"(2.869+.001)*100=287.0;(9.072+.002)*10=90.74; subtract196.26 then round196.3.","misconception":null},
