    "mode":"single","concepts":[16],
    "stem":"Simplify $\\sqrt7\\,\\sqrt5$ and $\\sqrt{3.1}\\,\\sqrt{4.5}$ to single radicals, then use lower-main addition in the supplied table. Round the resulting table numbers to $0.01$, with positive halfway cases rounded upward. Which ordered pair results?",
