      {"id":"B","text":"$[5,\\infty)$; $[0,\\infty)$; $[0,\\infty)$; $[0,\\infty)$.","truth":"incorrect","derivation":"Impose only nonnegative radicands and never exclude a zero denominator.","misconception":"Checking radical existence but not division by zero."},
